Error [E2422]: Compiler-only `Never` cannot be a function return or parameter type.
  --> tests/ui/never_public_contract.jet:1:17
    |
  1 | fn impossible() Never -> panic("stop")
    |                 ^^^^^
 Why: `Never` records a non-returning path; it is not a value type in a public function contract (D-NEVER1).
 Fix: Remove `Never` from the return or parameter type; use `()` for a result with no information.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2422

